        "Consider the final physical analogy of the official commissioning ceremony of a multi-billion-dollar aircraft carrier battle fleet by the naval admiralty. The fleet does not leave port based on paper blueprints. In the grand naval auditorium, the fleet admiral reviews the final readiness reports: 'Combat Information Center radar?' 'Fully operational.' 'Automated air defense missile batteries?' 'Armed and linked.' 'Submarine sonar hunting teams?' 'On station in deep water.' 'Flight deck catapults and arrestor gear?' 'Certified 100% ready.' 'Naval legal and JAG officers?' 'All logs certified.' Only when every single operational command confirms total combat readiness does the admiral order the fleet to raise anchors and deploy for planetary maritime defense. Milestone 11 provides that exact supreme operational commissioning for enterprise cybersecurity platforms.",
